        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I verify that a mover is IBA‑approved and ISO‑9001:2015 certified in Kurla?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Ask the mover to present their IBA approval certificate and ISO‑9001:2015 compliance letter, both of which should display a valid registration number and expiry date. Cross‑check these details on the official IBA website or ISO registry. Reputable firms like Shree Ashirwad also display the badges on their website and office premises.</p>
