        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The total cost is shaped by the volume of goods, type of vehicle required, distance (Kurla to the destination hub), packing material choice, any special handling for fragile items, and applicable fuel surcharges. Seasonal demand and additional services such as unpacking or temporary storage can also affect the final invoice.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there minimum charges for packers and movers in Kurla, and how are they calculated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, most movers enforce a minimum charge to cover basic labor, equipment, and administrative fees. This floor fee is typically calculated on a per‑hour basis for small moves or a fixed amount for short‑distance relocations. The exact minimum varies by company but is disclosed upfront in the cost matrix.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I shift my two‑wheelers or bikes via train transport, and what are the typical charges?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad offers dedicated two‑wheel carrier services that can be combined with rail freight for cost efficiency. Charges depend on bike dimensions, weight, and the train’s freight class, generally ranging from ₹1,200 to ₹2,500 per bike for inter‑state routes. Additional handling fees apply for loading and unloading at stations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer packaging protect delicate items like glassware during an 850 km haul?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each layer adds a specific defense: high‑density bubble wrap absorbs shocks, corrugated sheets provide structural rigidity, foam edge protectors shield corners, stretch film prevents moisture ingress, and custom wooden crates lock the item in place. Together they reduce vibration impact and prevent breakage, ensuring safe delivery even on rough highways.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for a hassle‑free shift from Kurla to another state?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid ID proof, original address proof, a signed packing list, GST invoice (if applicable), e‑Way bill for goods movement, and insurance acknowledgment. For corporate or government transfers, additional clearance letters may be required. Providing complete paperwork speeds up checkpost clearance and reduces delays.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad handle last‑minute changes or emergency relocations in Kurla?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The company maintains a 24/7 operations desk and a fleet of standby trucks. Upon receiving a last‑minute request, they assess vehicle availability, adjust the route plan, and provide an updated quote within an hour. Emergency moves are prioritized, and customers receive real‑time GPS tracking to monitor progress.</p>
